"tanuki.news.dyingVoice.title" : "Tanuki Addon: Introducing Dying Voice Message!"
"tanuki.news.dyingVoice.shortTitle" : "Tanuki Addon: New Modifier"
"tanuki.news.dyingVoice.subtitle" : "Leave your last words here."
"tanuki.news.interviewer.title" : "Tanuki Addon: Introducing the Interviewer!"
"tanuki.news.interviewer.shortTitle" : "Tanuki Addon: Interviewer Added"
"tanuki.news.interviewer.subtitle" : "Bring their testimony to the meeting."
"tanuki.news.interviewer.body" : "Tanuki Addon 0.1.0-β11 introduces the Interviewer, a new Crewmate role!<br><br>Activate your ability to record your own voice and the voices of living players in your sight for the configured duration. Press the voice recorder button at the upper left of the meeting to play the recording to everyone.<br><br>If a meeting begins while recording, the captured portion is saved and recording ends. Recording again overwrites the previous recording.<br><br>Configure recording duration, cooldown and playbacks per meeting. Choose 1–10 plays or unlimited; the allowance resets at the next meeting.<br><br>Requires a compatible Tanuki BetterCrewLink version: desktop or Lite v3.2.36 or later, Web/Mobile 3.28 or later, or .NET 3.2.36-net-beta.1 or later. Web/Mobile participants also need a host running a compatible Tanuki BetterCrewLink version."
"tanuki.news.dyingVoice.body" : "Dying Voice Message is a modifier whose assignment is hidden from its owner while alive.<br><br>After death, your voice is automatically recorded for a limited time and left at the death location. Living players who approach hear the recording with a radio-style effect.<br><br>Your last words might help solve the case.<br><br>The recording duration, playback range, location icon visibility and looping playback can all be configured.<br><br>Requires Tanuki BetterCrewLink v3.2.35 or later."
